- Second runner: 60 - 3 = 57 seconds
- Third runner: 57 - 3 = 54 seconds
- Fourth runner: 54 - 3 = 51 seconds

Total time for the less well-rounded team = 60 + 57 + 54 + 51 = 222 seconds.

Now, we find the difference in time between the two teams:
Difference = Time of less well-rounded team - Time of well-rounded team = 222 seconds - 220 seconds = 2 seconds.

